          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"a68e6738b03c\">Update from the 09/25 internal sync — Cedrick tested the record-type defaulting behavior described in this ticket:</p><ul data-local-id=\"2bfb1f0c73a4\"><li data-local-id=\"35c7e8097c92\"><p data-local-id=\"6d71613e8879\">Removing create access for Operator, Partner, and Player record types <strong>at the profile level</strong> (not the permission set) makes <strong>Referrer</strong> the automatic default when a rep clicks New — this eliminates the record-type selection screen entirely for that path.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"bc0362c27904\"><p data-local-id=\"91ad2202220c\">Important distinction: this only needs to restrict <em>create</em> access. Reps retain view access to existing Operator/Partner/Player records and can still see those page layouts — they just can&#039;t create new records of those types.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"30a41840c047\"><p data-local-id=\"61ede6fe574d\">Current gap: record-type access is also being granted via the <strong>permission set</strong>, which would override the profile restriction and bring the selection screen back if that permission set is assigned directly to reps. <strong>Fix requires moving record-type access off the permission set and onto the profile.</strong></p></li><li data-local-id=\"e7c2bcb789c5\"><p data-local-id=\"c0ad2a681b6f\">Open confirmation needed before this ships: confirm with the team/Emily that reps only ever need to create Referrers — not Players, Operators, or Partners. Kobi is ~99% confident on Operator/Partner, but Players specifically needs a double-check.</p><ul data-local-id=\"bf0a4c997bef\"><li data-local-id=\"479ffca1b456\"><p data-local-id=\"1be2769f0990\"><a href=\"https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/C0BBC05C2HG/p1790357535091369\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\">https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/C0BBC05C2HG/p1790357535091369</a> </p></li></ul></li></ul>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "created": "2026-09-25T13:27:34.538-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-25T13:32:41.393-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
