          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"e02e84dbc8c2\"><span data-local-id=\"3c1db702-d124-4414-bc68-1a350058f30d\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:d3ffd30a-2b90-4bcc-99d4-29fe0303d278\">@Cedrick Infantado</span> Emily confirmed reps ONLY create Referrers ✅</p>",
