          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"7e59ecf316f6\"><strong>Changes made:</strong><br>Record type assignment will be handled through profiles moving forward.<br></p><table data-local-id=\"5c40a7e4-6b5c-4008-9b94-892e97a17662\"><tbody><tr><td data-local-id=\"59ef85635374\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"836dd522289a\">Metadata Name</p></td><td data-local-id=\"e0c25318467a\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"b5da27a54c12\">Metadata Type</p></td><td data-local-id=\"fcee15b764e3\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"c13f84124ca6\">Action</p></td><td data-local-id=\"e1621a1f9605\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"b06976bb68a3\">Notes</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"28e3d7e91e95\"><p data-local-id=\"9cd3d4446d31\">WagerTech Sales Rep</p></td><td data-local-id=\"58a9683a9ed2\"><p data-local-id=\"2ef0613db229\">Profile</p></td><td data-local-id=\"613e9e6d5b59\"><p data-local-id=\"344630d84b04\">Update Component</p></td><td data-local-id=\"c2a372ee8057\"><p data-local-id=\"a3d45a235fe4\">Retain Referrer account record type. Remove Operator, Partner, Player as option.</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"75b3b7dbdc3b\"><p data-local-id=\"52f1ed43be02\">WT_Account_Operator_Edit</p></td><td data-local-id=\"371ca1c679dc\"><p data-local-id=\"b331871a6942\">PermissionSet</p></td><td data-local-id=\"a51b8211d056\"><p data-local-id=\"99c1e378bd39\">Update Component</p></td><td data-local-id=\"595dab2f034d\"><p data-local-id=\"0848f4ca0be8\">Remove access to Operator record type</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"b8287b9e3fdc\"><p data-local-id=\"f346c5c5b946\">WT_Account_Operator_Read</p></td><td data-local-id=\"a33b71b7464f\"><p data-local-id=\"1bb5bd40416b\">PermissionSet</p></td><td data-local-id=\"69fffcac8312\"><p data-local-id=\"ccc2b41acbee\">Update Component</p></td><td da